### Alle acts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts

### Niveau 1 — acts van één dag
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts?day=SATURDAY

### Niveau 1 — één act
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/4

### Niveau 1 — nieuwe act (verwacht 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/acts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "De Nachtegalen",
  "genre": "INDIE",
  "stage": "CLUB",
  "day": "FRIDAY",
  "startTime": "17:00",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "fee": 2500,
  "headliner": false
}

### Niveau 1 — act aanpassen
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/acts/3
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kraak",
  "genre": "ROCK",
  "stage": "MARQUEE",
  "day": "FRIDAY",
  "startTime": "20:15",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "fee": 3500,
  "headliner": false
}

### Niveau 1 — act verwijderen (verwacht 204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/acts/18

### Niveau 2 — onbestaand id (verwacht 404)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/999

### Niveau 2 — ongeldige act (verwacht 400)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/acts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "",
  "genre": "POP",
  "durationMinutes": 5,
  "fee": -10
}

### Niveau 2 — uitdaging: tweede headliner op vrijdag MAIN (verwacht 409)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/acts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nog een headliner",
  "genre": "ROCK",
  "stage": "MAIN",
  "day": "FRIDAY",
  "startTime": "23:30",
  "durationMinutes": 60,
  "fee": 30000,
  "headliner": true
}

### Niveau 3 — zoeken met gecombineerde filters
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/search?day=SATURDAY&after=20:00

### Niveau 3 — zoeken: rock-headliners
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/search?genre=ROCK&headliner=true

### Niveau 3 — affiche
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/poster?day=FRIDAY

### Niveau 3 — vertraging
POST http://localhost:8080/api/acts/delay?day=FRIDAY&stage=MAIN&minutes=30

### Niveau 3 — statistieken
GET http://localhost:8080/api/acts/stats
